{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-03_beg","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-03","title":"同时走失","storyCode":"6-3","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"11cf5cb4d42139a2830f4adde0f5df5da651f32da9fd6497e7a12ad5f27c3882","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"梅菲斯特施展法术，让他的牧群愈发狂躁，甚至开始了无差别攻击。\n不忍目睹这种情况的浮士德决定出手援救己方。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcity_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚才释放了什么法术？你的......队伍，比之前更狂躁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"他们......他们很痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你看到了啊？我种下去的种子开花了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的，浮士德，他们不会攻击我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"你还在催化他们的感染？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特......停手吧。我们能活下去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"只有我的法术能做到这种事情，也只有这样，我们才有可能逃出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你在侦察的时候也看得很清楚了吧，如果我们以现在的状态强行突破，近卫局在我们抵达贫民区的秘密通道之前，就能把我们全杀掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你以前见过那些武器吗？那些连切尔诺伯格的守卫都没用过的武器！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"他们太熟悉这座城市了，而我们只是些外来人！他们从哪里出现？又会在哪里消失？！仅凭现在这点人，我们没法与他们正面对抗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"切尔诺伯格的乌萨斯人太弱了......龙门把我们当军队看待，可我们不是军队，我们带领着的，只是些想活下去的同胞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"声音轻些。我们的士气相当低落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"但我的牧群根本不会因为这种事情动摇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......还有刚刚和我们汇合的很多整合运动成员在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"霜星一定会来支援我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"霜星？那个霜星？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，呵呵，她和她的雪怪，难道不是也背叛了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"否则凭他们的实力，有什么能拦得住他们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我不怪他们。哪怕是背叛，他们也只是为了生存。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"霜星不会背叛。我们不是说好了，要自己去看到真相？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......大家都在为了生存而努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"别冲动，别被近卫局的计策冲昏头脑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我有办法，浮士德。我可以让我的同胞们更好地活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......？你要做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我要让近卫局看看比军队更可怕的东西。他们绝对无法想象我同胞们绽放出的花朵是什么样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局一定要为他们的所作所为付出代价......那个陈，一定要为伤害你付出代价！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我的同胞们，我的族裔们，响应我吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的牧群","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的体内有着远比现在更旺盛的生命......去追索那种冲动，去散播你们的种子、你们的未来吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"不，梅菲斯特！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"他们是活的人啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特的牧群","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（混乱的尖叫声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"整个龙门都是你们的土壤！去啊，去把你们的生命传递给其他人！快去，快去，快去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6_7"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6_7"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6_7"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？啊？！怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你，你要干嘛？我们和你不是一个小队的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我没在背后说过你们什么！也没说梅菲斯特......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"队长？队长呢？！队长！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！！怎，怎么，你怎么咬我！！为什么......呃呃呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救命！！救命！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊，啊！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"他们比以前更强了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然他们已经听不见我的声音了，但他们不会再攻击我们......他们会越来越壮、越来越强、越来越多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门会被它们彻底毁灭。哼，我的同胞们得不到龙门，龙门人也别想继续保留这座城市！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德，走吧，我们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"你做了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧群","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧群","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（痛苦的嘶嚎）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德？你去哪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么梅菲斯特的手下在攻击我们？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像看到......糟糕，糟糕，刚才被他们拖走的伊万......我看到了！伊万好像也变成那种样子了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"苏卡，什么怪物......这是什么怪物！！打了他们也不会痛，刺了也不会死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"他们比刚才狂躁了好几倍！我们已经有点打不过了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"你们，跟我来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"别去，可能是梅菲斯特的陷阱！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"......这小子救过我的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特是个混蛋，他不一定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"从这里走，快。幻影弩手会保护你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢......等，等下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"当心！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"——源石投掷物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"快走！牧群的目标是你们！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"灰喉，敌人的动向很奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"重装干员会尽力维持阵线，我们术师着重削减敌人的数量，有法术能力的感染者，就交给你和其他狙击干员处理了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"我射杀感染者，也是可以容许的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"灰喉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"有可能的话，我不容许任何人伤害感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我是不是允许别人这么做，别人是不是允许感染者伤害其他人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"没有任何意义。这些学说在战场上没有意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真的有可能，没人应该伤害他人。无论是感染者还是普通人，都一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"我会照做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔会为我们提供医疗支援，所以......注意自己的状况，别受伤。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......奇怪？那些是......梅菲斯特的牧群......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但我......我怎么一点情感都感受不到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不对。不对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"灰喉，快下来！事情不对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"它们......竟然在拔出身上的源石？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"灰喉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！你没事吧？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我没事！你小心！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哪冒出来这么多牧群？动作都完全变了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，你那位置还算比较安全！待在那别动！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我先把这些东西都解决了再说！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["梅菲斯特"]},{"speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","aliases":["浮士德"]},{"speakerId":"char_367_swllow","aliases":["灰喉"]}]}
